mapping "Y2400.1" source="Y2400" target="219334005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source Y2400 SNOMED CT 219334005 = a Swedish ICD-10-SE national extension that subdivides Y24
        (Athena ICD10 concept 45756507) by Swedish place/activity axes with no separate standard SNOMED CT
        analogue. Target SNOMED CT 435155 = (sctid 219334005), the verified Athena crosswalk target for Y24
        (ICD10 relationship 45756507 -> 435155). Why this target: it is the authoritative standard
        concept the parent Y24 maps to, and the SE subdivision is fully contained by it.
        mapping_type=broader (target subsumes the source). Confidence (high): verified crosswalk with a
        small, well-understood breadth mismatch. Athena-local research only.
        """
}
